'''Description:''' Clerics who take the Water domain command power over creatures of the Elemental Planes and are granted spells that weaken or kill opponents.[[Image:Id water.gif|right|Water]]
== Domain Special Abilities ==

Able to [[Turn undead|turn]] [[elemental]]s as if they were [[undead]].

== Bonus Spells ==
* Level 3 [[Poison (spell)|Poison]]
* Level 5 [[Ice storm]]

==Notes==
*The cleric can turn elementals without penalty as if they were undead.
*[[Sun domain]] improves the strength of turning.

